        "id": "rehgar",
        "name": "Rehgar"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Chen likes to play together with Heroes that can empower his dive (such as Tyrael), dive with him (for example Abathur), provide waveclear (like Rehgar), clear Mercenary Camps (for example Greymane), and/or offer crowd control (such as Johanna)."
  },
  "counters": {
    "heroes": [
      {
