    "explanation": "Chen performs better on Maps where he needs to take care of a single lane, the Boss Camp is a strong win condition, and macro is not that important.\n\nDue to his mediocre waveclear, Chen is not that good on Maps where double soaking is important (such as Towers of Doom), even if he can still provide good value in team fights thanks to his Heroic Abilities.\n\nChen does not excel on big Maps (like Garden of Terror) because, when it comes to macro, he cannot compete with Heroes who can quickly clear Minions or do Mercenary Camps alone."
