    {
      "name": "Stagger Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Chen's Stagger Build focuses on increasing your survivability by making Stagger more efficient and boosting your damage output by empowering your Basic Attacks and Breath of Fire.\n\nAccumulating Flame at Level 1 progressively increases your damage output during the game and, more importantly, your waveclear. In order to get more stacks, remember to hit enemy Heroes whenever it is safe to do so.\n\nCombined together, Gift of the Ox at Level 7 and Celerity at Level 16 make Chen harder to kill. The latter can reduce Stagger's cooldown, which makes you get more value from both Talents.\n\nWithering Flames at Level 4 allows you to trade better with enemy Heroes without getting in melee range. A Touch of Honey at Level 13 helps you engage or stick on enemy Heroes.",
